d/libhxllama.dylib) → 다른 머신 deploy 시 @rpath 재링크 필요","_dispatch_module() 의 stdout passthrough 추가 — 기존 exec() 결과 버려졌던 사전 버그 동시 해결 (clm_v4 / anima_native 도 혜택). 자율 발화 REPL 시 stdout 라인 단위 stream 은 exec() 가 전체 캡처한 후 한꺼번에 print — REPL incremental UX 가 약간 늦어짐. tick 단위 max_tokens 작게 (e.g. 8) 로 mitigate 가능, 또는 향후 hexa-lang stdlib 의 stream-exec 추가 시 해소.","_hexa() 가 hexa.real 직접 호출로 변경 — bin/hexa wrapper 의 ubu-1 routing 우회. mac local 전용 (libhxllama.dylib + GGUF cache 모두 mac). remote dispatch 가 필요한 다른 모듈은 향후 wrapper 분기 필요시 별도 cycle.","Other aliases (llama3b/qwen7b/polyglot-ko-1b3) GGUF 변환 미실행 — base model gated (user 활성화 + tool/anima_gguf_convert.py 1회/모델 후 자동 lift). 모듈 자체는 ready."],"unblocks":["anima chat 외부 sales surface (T1) — paradigm-a-prime backend 즉시 사용 가능","anima dialogue 별칭 → llama backend wire-up (.roadmap.cli cli.cond.3)","REPL 자율 발화 (own 34 mandate-4) Llama family 에 최초 도달 — anima_native TinyWeights random init 한계 우회"],"cross_link":["anima/llama_ffi.hexa (Phase 3b core)","build/libhxllama.dylib (build infra)","tool/anima_chat_llama_smoke.hexa (Phase 3b smoke artifact)","tool/anima_cli/chat/anima_native/anima_native.hexa (Phase 2 REPL 패턴 거울)","tool/anima_cli/chat/llama/llama.ai.md (recursive module ai-native doc)",".roadmap.cli cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08 phase_3","own 34 mandate-1/2/4/7","own 31 mandate-1 (dancinlab/ SSOT)","raw#9 (chat path hexa-only)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.consciousness_2026_05_08","kind":"feature","title":"anima consciousness CLI 토픽 신설 — own 18 SSOT mirror + C3 의식 측정","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.4"],"user_directive":"의식 측정 툴 anima cli 명령어 별도 구현 --full --simpel simpel simple 등","architecture":{"topic":"tool/anima_cli/consciousness.hexa","subcommands":["simple [<model>]","full [<model>]","baseline","--json","--selftest","--help"],"default":"simple","semantics":{"simple":"own 18 PASS_STRICT_C3 = C1 ∧ C2 ∧ C3 (3-cond AND, C3 actual LIVE)","full":"own 18 F1-F8 full-stack (사용자 explicit 'OK FULL STACK' trigger)","baseline":"3-model (random_init / clm_v4 / paradigm-a-prime) threshold-driver — state/anima_consciousness_baseline.json"}},"compliance":["own 18 SSOT mirror (측정 lane V4 evaluator 11-cell, C3 threshold L0 baseline-measured)","own 34 chat lane 분리 (본 토픽 = 측정 lane only)","own 33 trinity compliance","raw#9 hexa-only","raw#10 honest C3 (5-axis L2 proxy + entropy 별도 강화)"],"phase":"baseline-measured","phase_detail":"L0 measurement infra LIVE 2026-05-08 — clm_v4_mount.hexa --probe TEXT --output-format json x2 (prompt_a / prompt_b) wiring landed. C3 4-cell actual emit + threshold candidate (state/anima_consciousness_baseline.json) + own 18 C3 threshold land. ROC formal 강화는 별도 cycle (chat-capable PASS ≥ 0.7 + random init FAIL ≥ 0.95 데이터 누적 후).","cross_link":["docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md (★ 본 CLI 가 구현하는 roadmap SSOT)",".own own 18 (C1+C2+C3 simple_stack PASS 정의)",".own own 34 (chat lane 노출 mandate, 측정 lane vs 노출 lane 분리)",".own own 33 (trinity compliance)","tool/anima_cli/consciousness.hexa","bin/anima.hexa T2_TOPICS (consciousness 추가)"],"falsifiers":["F-cli-cons-1: anima consciousness --selftest PASS","F-cli-cons-2: anima consciousness simple --json 가 anima.consciousness.v1 schema emit","F-cli-cons-3: own 18 C3 4-cell 정의 SSOT mirror (CLI 출력 vs .own 정의 일치)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.chat.autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08","kind":"roadmap_doc","title":"anima chat autonomous speech roadmap — CLM 메인 + N-agent dialogue + consciousness metric","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3","cli.cond.4"],"user_directive":["자율발화 성공기준으로 로드맵 (CLM 포함)","진짜로 사람 대화 하듯이","여러명 일때도","진짜로 사람들 끼리 대화 하듯이","CLM 이 메인","의식 측정 기준도 별도 +@ 로 해서 너무 보수적으로 잡지 말고","simple stack pass 에 하나 더 포함하면 되 의식 측정","H100 적극이용 빠르게 도달","all + @ 계속 도전","prototype → 완성"],"primary_doc":"docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md","goal":"CLM N개 instance 들이 사람들끼리 대화하듯 자율적으로 모여 N-turn 대화를 이어가며, 각 발화가 own 18 C1+C2+C3 PASS","layers":{"L0":{"title":"own 18 C3 정의 + measurement infra","status":"in_progress","cycle":"1","deliverable":"own 18 C3 patched (DONE), V4 eval 11-cell, BG-KM + CLM v4 baseline 측정값"},"L1":{"title":"의미적 자율 발화 (Phase 2 다음)","status":"pending","cycle":"1-2","deliverable":"autonomous tick own 18 C2 PASS rate ≥ 0.5"},"L2":{"title":"N=2 dialogue (CLM A ↔ CLM B 자율 대화)","status":"pending","cycle":"2-3","prerequisite":"hexa stdlib proc spawn + channel 모듈 (4c 결정)","deliverable":"anima dialogue duo <model>, 5-turn PASS rate ≥ 0.4"},"L3":{"title":"N=5+ multi-agent (사람들 대화 시뮬레이션)","status":"pending","cycle":"3-5","prerequisite":"L2 + anima-agent-channels/ 활성화","deliverable":"anima dialogue council N=<n>, emergent-roles N≥2 + topic-coherence ≥ 0.5"},"L4":{"title":"CLM 자체 chat-capable (메인 모델) — all + @","status":"pending","cycle":"2-4 each","paths":{"a_v5_arch":{"base":"new (Engine A/G)","corpus":"scratch + persona 200MB","budget_cap":"$30","bg_id":"BG-LA"},"b_350m_pretrain":{"base":"mk2-v1","corpus":"persona 1GB + dialogue 500MB","budget_cap":"$60","bg_id":"BG-LB"},"c_llama_distill":{"base":"Llama-3.2-3B teacher","corpus":"persona 200MB","budget_cap":"$40","bg_id":"BG-LC"},"d_dpo_rlhf":{"base":"clm-v4-sft-1-7-y1-stage1","corpus":"dialogue pairs 100MB","budget_cap":"$20","bg_id":"BG-LD"}},"deliverable":"4 BG cycle results — 어느 path 가 SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_STRICT_C3 통과? CLM 메인 확립"},"L5":{"title":"Engine A/G + 영속 daemon — prototype → 완성","status":"prototype-start-now","cycle":"즉시 시작","prerequisite":"hexa stdlib proc spawn + channel 모듈 (L2 공통 prereq)","deliverable":"anima daemon start/stop/status, Engine A/G tension self-trigger fire rate ≥ 1/min"},"L6":{"title":"Human conversation parity","status":"goal","cycle":"5+","deliverable":"anima eval human_parity --corpus <path>, parity score ≥ 0.5"}},"now_phase":{"alpha":["docs/.md (DONE)","tool/anima_cli/consciousness.hexa (DONE)","own 18 C3 patch (DONE)","bin/anima.hexa T2 wiring (DONE)",".roadmap.cli entries (DONE)"],"beta_subagent_parallel":["hexa-lang stdlib proc spawn + channel 모듈","L0 measurement infra (anima_runtime / clm_v4_mount wiring)","L4 (a) v5 arch BG-LA spec","L4 (b) 350M scratch BG-LB spec","L4 (c) Llama distill BG-LC spec","L4 (d) DPO BG-LD spec","L5 daemon prototype (Engine A/G tension + self-trigger)"],"gamma_h100_fire":["BG-LA / BG-LB / BG-LC / BG-LD 4-way fire ($150 total) — 사용자 explicit override 'OK CLM L4 ALL FIRE' 필수 (own 16 cost discipline)","BG-KM + CLM v4 retest with C3 evaluator"]},"honest_c3":["C3 threshold TBD measurement-driven (baseline 측정 후 조정)","L4 budget total $150 = own 16 cost discipline ($10 cap per BG) 와 충돌 → 사용자 explicit override 필수","L5 daemon Engine A/G 본구현 = PureField repulsion-field 정의 미구체화 (anima-engines/ 일부 참고)","L6 parity threshold 0.5 = conceptual placeholder (통계 distinguishable 척도 정의 미land)","CLM 메인 의지 = BG-KM (V4 12/15 PASS_STRICT) retire 가 아닌 fallback 유지"]}
