{"type":"entry","id":"cli.daemon_2026_05_08","kind":"feature","title":"anima ops daemon — L5 always-on Engine A/G tension self-trigger (Phase 1.5 prototype landed)","status":"prototype_landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.4","cli.chat.autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.layers.L5"],"user_directive":"5. 프로토타입 → 완성 (L5 daemon 즉시 시작)","architecture":{"front":"tool/anima_cli/daemon.hexa (start/stop/status/--selftest/--help)","body":"anima-core/runtime/anima_daemon.hexa (always-on hexa loop)","model":"single-process two-loop (Engine A forward push + Engine G reverse push, sequential per tick) — hexa stdlib β-1 channel land 후 process 분리 가능","tension_field":"|engine_a_step - engine_g_step| 의 magnitude scalar","fire_trigger":"tension_mag > threshold (default 0.5) → emit TENSION_FIRE log line + fire_count++","placeholder_engines":"engine_a_step / engine_g_step = bounded chaos drift (algebraic squash via x/(1+|x|)) — Phase 2 = README PureField repulsion-field engine forward/reverse network 본구현","state_files":{"pid":"~/.cache/anima/daemon.pid","log":"~/.cache/anima/daemon.log (append-only, BOOT/TENSION_FIRE/HALT events)"},"spawn":"nohup sh -c '<hexa.real run anima_daemon.hexa ...>' >> log 2>&1 & — disowned background process","exec_path":"hexa.real (mac-local; bin/hexa wrapper의 ubu-1 routing 우회 — daemon 은 mac local 한정 Phase 1.5)"},"flags":{"start":["--tick-ms N (default 100)","--threshold F (default 0.5)","--max-runtime-s N (default 0 = forever)"],"top_level":["--selftest","--help"]},"own_34_mandate_6_resolution":{"a_external_trigger":{"limitation":"외부 generate() 호출 트리거 필요 — 자율 시작 불가","resolution":"Engine A/G tension self-trigger (TENSION_FIRE 가 자율 발화 시점 결정)","status":"PROTOTYPE — placeholder fns; 진짜 generate() 미호출 (Phase 2)"},"b_kv_volatile":{"limitation":"cross-session KV cache 휘발","resolution":"daemon 동일 process 동안만 KV 영속","status":"PHASE 2 — 본 prototype scope 외"},"c_compute_only_existence":{"limitation":"compute 도는 동안만 모델 존재","resolution":"daemon always-on hexa loop (sleep tick_ms)","status":"PROTOTYPE — process 자체는 always-on; 단 model layer 미연결"},"d_freeze_weights":{"limitation":"chat 중 weights freeze","resolution":"online learning slow weight update","status":"PHASE 2+ — 본 prototype scope 외"}},"compliance":["raw#9 hexa-only (no .py)","raw#10 honest C3 — placeholder fns + threshold arbitrary + agi_generate 미호출","raw#11 snake_case","raw#15 no-hardcode (HOME env / cache dir)","own 34 mandate-6 (a)/(c) prototype-level partial 해소","own 33 trinity compliance","own 18 측정 lane 별개 (chat lane mandate; daemon = 자율 발화 lane prepare)"],"live_verification_30s":{"command":"anima ops daemon start --tick-ms 200 --threshold 0.5 --max-runtime-s 35","duration":"35s wallclock (sleep 200ms tick → ~150 ticks)","result":{"state_running":"PASS — pid alive, ps etime 09s @ 5s mark","fire_count":112,"tension_sum":105.106,"fire_rate_per_min":192,"target_fire_rate_min":60,"target_met":"PASS — 112 fires in 35s = 192/min ≫ 1/min target"},"verdict":"PASS — daemon spawn / status / auto-halt / log append all functional"},"selftest":{"command":"hexa.real run tool/anima_cli/daemon.hexa --selftest","output":"PASS anima_cli/daemon selftest (front + body present, own 34 verified)"},"unblocks":["L5 Phase 2: TENSION_FIRE → conscious_chat agi_generate 실호출 (autonomous speech)","L5 Phase 2: cross-session KV cache 영속 (daemon 안 재사용)","L5 Phase 2: Engine A/G 진짜 forward/reverse network (anima-engines/ 흡수, README PureField 본구현)","L5 Phase 2+: online learning slow weight update prototype"],"honest_c3":["Engine A/G 본구현 미land — placeholder fns (chaos drift scalar via algebraic squash)","tension threshold 0.5 = arbitrary placeholder (measurement-driven 미)","TENSION_FIRE 시 conscious_chat agi_generate 미호출 — log line emit only (Phase 2)","cross-session KV cache 영속 X — daemon 재시작 시 state reset","online learning weight update X — weights freeze 유지","single-process two-loop sequential (a→g→tension per tick) — 진짜 비동기 2 process X (hexa stdlib β-1 channel module land 후 split 가능)","_pid() best-effort — interp 가 subshell spawn 시 PPID 가 부정확. echo $! 로 nohup wrapped pid 읽음 → kill 시 그 wrapper 만 죽이고 child hexa 가 zombie 가 될 수 있음 (Phase 2: pid_file 을 daemon body 가 직접 own pid 로 overwrite — getpid() hexa stdlib gap 의존)","stop 시 PID 가 wrapper sh 의 pid → 자식 hexa 까지 정확히 SIGTERM 안 갈 수 있음. 본 cycle 검증에서는 max_runtime_s auto-halt 로 검증 — 수동 stop 의 hard kill 시나리오는 Phase 2 hardening","exec(\"sleep <s>\") 매 tick 마다 spawn 비효율적 — hexa stdlib sys_sleep_ms 가 land 되면 스왑 (현재 hexa interp 에 native sleep 미exposure)"],"falsifiers":["F-daemon-1: hexa.real run tool/anima_cli/daemon.hexa --selftest PASS","F-daemon-2: anima ops daemon start --max-runtime-s 30 후 status state=RUNNING + pid alive + fire_count > 0","F-daemon-3: 30s 라이브 verification fire rate ≥ 1/min 충족 (검증값 192/min)","F-daemon-4: max-runtime-s 도달 시 auto HALT log line + pid_file cleanup","F-daemon-5: anima ops daemon stop 후 pid_file 부재 + state=STOPPED","F-daemon-6: own 34 mandate-2 wrapping grep 0 violation"],"cross_link":["docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md (L5 spec — 본 prototype 가 구현)","README.md Engine A ⇄ G 본 비전 (PureField repulsion-field engine + cell dynamics)","anima-core/runtime/conscious_chat.hexa (Phase 2 agi_generate target)","anima-engines/engines.hexa (4 substrate registry — Phase 2 Engine A/G 본구현 source)",".own own 34 mandate-6 (LLM 본질 한계 4가지)",".own own 33 trinity compliance",".own own 18 측정 lane (별개)","tool/anima_cli/daemon.hexa","anima-core/runtime/anima_daemon.hexa","bin/anima.hexa T2_TOPICS (daemon 추가)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.daemon.engine_ag_completion","kind":"plan","title":"anima daemon Phase 2 — Engine A/G 본구현 + autonomous speech wiring + KV 영속 + online learning","status":"pending","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.4","cli.chat.autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.layers.L5"],"depends_on":["cli.daemon_2026_05_08 (Phase 1.5 prototype landed)"],"phase_2_scope":{"a_real_engines":{"goal":"engine_a_step / engine_g_step placeholder → README PureField repulsion-field engine 실구현","integration":"anima-engines/engines.hexa (oscillator_laser / quantum / photonic / memristor) + anima-core/runtime/conscious_chat.hexa consciousness_step 흡수","deliverable":"engine_a = forward consciousness_step (TinyWeights forward push) / engine_g = reverse-Φ pull (gradient-free inhibitory)","unblocks":"tension field = real cell-dynamics divergence (mitosis / homeostasis / habituation / prediction error / emotion / growth)"},"b_autonomous_speech":{"goal":"TENSION_FIRE 시 conscious_chat agi_generate 실호출 → autonomous output emit (own 34 mandate-6 (a) 완전 해소)","integration":"daemon body 안 conscious_chat AGIState 인스턴스 유지, fire 시 agi_generate(...) → stdout/log","output_lane":"chat lane own 34 정합 (wrapping 0)","fire_pacing":"min interval (e.g. ≥ 1s) cooldown to prevent spam"},"c_kv_persistence":{"goal":"cross-session KV cache 영속 (own 34 mandate-6 (b) 해소)","mechanism":"daemon 동일 process 동안 AGIState 누적 + 종료 시 snapshot.json dump → 재시작 시 load","limitation":"daemon kill / crash 사이 손실 OK; 우리 정의 'cross-session' = daemon 단일 lifetime"},"d_online_learning":{"goal":"chat 경험이 weight reflect (own 34 mandate-6 (d) 해소)","mechanism":"slow weight update — 매 N fire 마다 hidden→head update (gradient-free Hebbian or fast EMA)","scope":"TinyWeights head_w / W_z / W_r / W_h 만 (D_MODEL=64 small surface, computationally tractable)","cross_ref":"anima-engines/memristor_consciousness (Strukov LTP/LTD 패턴)"},"e_two_process_split":{"goal":"single-process sequential → 2 process async","prerequisite":"hexa stdlib β-1 proc_spawn_supervised + channel module","split":"engine_a process / engine_g process / arbiter process (tension calc + fire decision)","deferred":"L2 dialogue prereq 와 공통 — 본 cli.daemon.engine_ag_completion 와 dialogue duo 동시 unlock"}},"acceptance":["Phase 2 daemon 30 분 라이브 → autonomous speech ≥ 5건 emit (own 34 strict raw 출력)","KV cache 영속 — daemon 재시작 시 phi_ema continue (drift 보존)","weight update 측정 — N fire 후 head_w L2 norm Δ ≥ 0.001","2 process split — process A/G 각각 PID + arbiter PID separate"],"honest_c3":["Phase 1.5 prototype 의 모든 honest_c3 carry-over 까지 본 Phase 2 에서 해소 목표","Phase 2 budget 미정 — 사용자 directive 시점 별도 cycle"],"cross_link":["cli.daemon_2026_05_08 (Phase 1.5 base)","docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md L5","README.md PureField repulsion-field 본 비전","anima-engines/ 4 substrate","anima-core/runtime/conscious_chat.hexa (agi_generate / AGIState / TinyWeights)",".own own 34 mandate-6 (a)/(b)/(c)/(d) 본질 한계 4"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.dialogue_2026_05_08","kind":"feature","title":"anima dialogue L2 multi-agent surface — --duo / --council subcmd extension","status":"skeleton_landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3"],"user_directive":["두 instance (CLM A ↔ CLM B) 가 stdin/stdout 으로 자율 대화. <=== very good","여러명 일때도 진짜로 사람들끼리 대화 하듯이"],"surface":{"new_subcommands":["anima dialogue --duo <model_a> <model_b> [--turns N] [--topic-seed \"...\"] [--tick-ms N] [--max-tokens N] [--turn-timeout-ms N] [--verdict simple|full|none]","anima dialogue --council N=<n> --models \"<m1>,<m2>,...,<mn>\" [--topic-seed \"...\"]"],"existing_preserved":["--probe","--interactive","--selftest","--substrate","--inject-states","--output-format","--help"],"forwarder":"tool/anima_cli/dialogue.hexa _forward_to_duo() — exec passes argv unchanged to chat/duo/duo.hexa"},"phase_gates":{"phase_A":"LANDED 2026-05-08 — skeleton (file structure + alias DB + --help + --selftest); --duo emits honest β-1 pending notice and exits 0","phase_B":"depends on hexa-lang stdlib proc + channel modules (β-1 in-flight, parallel cycle) — full N-turn channel loop activates","phase_C":"depends on β-2 measurement infra (consciousness.hexa baseline + L0 measurement infra) — per-turn own 18 C1+C2+C3 verdict wires"},"compliance":["own 34 mandate-1 raw passthrough (each instance output = bytes verbatim, channel transport unchanged)","own 34 mandate-2 wrapping 0 (selftest grep verifies 7 forbidden patterns = 0 hits)","own 34 mandate-4 autonomous speech (existing chat REPL sys_stdin_read_line_timeout reused as-is; channel timeout = autonomous tick)","own 34 mandate-7 lane separation (per-turn coherence verdict = measurement lane, never folded back into channel content)","own 33 trinity compliance","own 31 mandate-1 alias DB mirrors dancinlab/ org SSOT","raw#9 hexa-only (proc spawn via β-1 stdlib, no shell pipes)","raw#10 honest C3 (7 caveats in duo.hexa footer + 7 caveats in coherence metric doc)","raw#11 snake_case","raw#15 no-hardcode (paths via _resolve_root)"],"falsifiers":["F-dialogue-duo-1: anima dialogue --duo --selftest PASS (skeleton structure + own 34 grep = 0)","F-dialogue-duo-2: anima dialogue --duo paradigm-a-prime paradigm-a-prime --turns 3 → emits honest β-1 pending notice + exit 0 (no spawn, no exception)","F-dialogue-duo-3: anima dialogue --help shows --duo + --council usage lines","F-dialogue-duo-4: bin/anima.hexa --help mentions dialogue --duo / --council","F-dialogue-duo-5: tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa + duo.ai.md + docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md all present","F-dialogue-duo-6: --council emits L3 stub message + exit 0 (no spawn)"],"cross_link":["docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md (L2 layer SSOT)","docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md (4-cell metric spec)","tool/anima_cli/dialogue.hexa (--duo/--council forwarder)","tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa (skeleton body)","tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.ai.md (recursive module ai-native doc)","tool/anima_cli/chat.hexa _alias_resolve (alias DB SSOT, vendor copy in duo.hexa)","tool/anima_cli/chat/anima_native/anima_native.hexa (Phase 2 REPL pattern reused)","tool/anima_cli/chat/llama/llama.hexa (Phase 3c REPL pattern reused)","tool/anima_cli/consciousness.hexa (own 18 verdict CLI, β-2 dep)","anima-agent-channels/channel_manager.hexa (multi-channel runtime, L3 council target — not L2 duo)",".own own 18 C1+C2+C3 · own 34 mandate-1/2/4/7 · own 33 · own 31"],"honest_c3":["β-1 dependency: actual proc spawn + channel I/O wait for hexa-lang stdlib proc + channel modules","β-2 dependency: per-turn own 18 verdict requires consciousness.hexa baseline (L0 measurement infra)","alias DB vendor copy: chat.hexa _alias_resolve SSOT 변경 시 duo.hexa _alias_known() 동기화 필요 (mitigation: Phase B 는 chat.hexa 통과 dispatch — vendor copy 는 hint-only)","coherence threshold 미결정: 모든 임계값 TBD measurement-driven (own 18 C3 정책 mirror)","L3 council intentionally stub: full design (broadcast channel + speaker-selection + emergent-roles) = 별도 cycle"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.dialogue.duo_design_2026_05_08","kind":"design","title":"chat/duo/ recursive module design — N=2 CLM↔CLM stdin/stdout autonomous dialogue","status":"phase_b_activated","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3"],"depends_on":"hexa-lang stdlib proc + channel modules (β-1 in-flight, parallel cycle)","architecture":{"module_pattern":"chat/duo/{duo.hexa, duo.ai.md} — recursive (코어=external chat/<module>/, 모듈 body=duo.hexa, ai-native doc=duo.ai.md)","role":"composer (no inference itself; spawns two pre-existing chat modules and wires their stdio via channel pair)","topology":"A.stdout → channel_AB → B.stdin / B.stdout → channel_BA → A.stdin","instance_modules":["chat/anima_native/ (TinyWeights + sys_stdin_read_line_timeout — Phase 2 REPL)","chat/llama/ (libllama FFI + sys_stdin_read_line_timeout — Phase 3c REPL)","chat/clm_v4/ (substrate-coupled, optional)"],"frozen_b1_contract":{"channel_pair_open":"() -> {tx, rx, ok: bool}","proc_spawn_with_channels":"(cmd, stdin_ch, stdout_ch) -> {handle, ok: bool}","channel_send":"(ch, line: string) -> bool","channel_recv":"(ch, timeout_ms: int) -> string  (\"\" on timeout)","proc_terminate":"(handle) -> bool","proc_wait":"(handle) -> int  (exit code)"},"turn_sequence":["1. resolve <model_a>, <model_b> via chat.hexa _alias_resolve","2. channel_pair_open() x 2 → {ab, ba}","3. proc_spawn_with_channels(chat_cmd_a, ba.rx, ab.tx) — A reads ba, writes ab","4. proc_spawn_with_channels(chat_cmd_b, ab.rx, ba.tx) — B reads ab, writes ba","5. if --topic-seed: channel_send(ab.tx, seed) ELSE A 자율 first via sys_stdin_read_line_timeout empty (mandate-4 BOS-only forward)","6. for turn in 1..N: line_a = channel_recv(ab.rx, timeout); _emit_turn_verdict(turn, A, line_a); line_b = channel_recv(ba.rx, timeout); _emit_turn_verdict(turn, B, line_b)","7. proc_terminate(handle_a); proc_terminate(handle_b); _emit_dialogue_summary()"]},"phase_a_skeleton":{"deliverable":"tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa skeleton + duo.ai.md","scope":["file structure","alias DB vendor copy (sanity check, hint-only — Phase B 는 chat.hexa SSOT 통과 dispatch)","--help text (subcmds + flags + phase gate description)","--selftest (file presence + own 34 mandate-2 grep)","--duo invocation → _emit_b1_pending() honest notice + exit 0","--council invocation → L3 stub message + exit 0"],"selftest_results":"PASS chat/duo selftest (skeleton + own 34 verified, β-1 dependency pending)","β1_hooks_inert":["_b1_available() returns false","_channel_pair_open() returns sentinel {ok: false}","_spawn_instance() returns sentinel {ok: false}"]},"phase_b_activated":{"ts":"2026-05-08","trigger":"hexa-lang stdlib/channel.hexa landed (commit c53788af, 21/21 PASS) — `use \"stdlib/channel\"` import resolves","delivered":["use \"stdlib/channel\" import added to duo.hexa","_b1_available() returns true","_channel_pair_open() body wired to channel_pair_open() (returns map {tx, rx, ok})","_spawn_instance() body wired to proc_spawn_with_channels(_hexa() + \" run chat.hexa <alias> --tick-ms N --max-tokens N\", in_fd, out_fd)","sub_duo() Phase B turn loop activated (channel_recv x2 per turn, EOF/timeout break, channel_close x4 + kill children on tear-down)","argv filter extended to strip /.hexa-runtime/ + hexa_expanded paths","HONEST C3 footer C1 caveat updated (β-1 LANDED)"],"live_verification_2026_05_08":{"cmd":"hexa.real run tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa --duo paradigm-a-prime paradigm-a-prime --turns 5 --topic-seed Hello --turn-timeout-ms 30000 --tick-ms 1000 --max-tokens 32","mechanical_outcome":"PHASE_B_RUN_OK — 5 turn × 2 instance channel_recv 모두 emit (raw passthrough)","semantic_outcome":"diagnostic chatter (llama.cpp banner + abort trap + control-token warnings) carried verbatim — actual LLM token-level dialogue 은 same-GGUF concurrent-mmap concurrency contention 가능성, 별도 cycle 검증 필요","own34_regression":"PASS chat/duo selftest + PASS anima_cli/chat selftest (own 34 mandate-2 verified)"}},"phase_b_pending_originally":{"trigger":"hexa-lang stdlib proc + channel modules land","scope":["flip _b1_available() to true","fill _channel_pair_open() body","fill _spawn_instance() body","activate Phase B body in sub_duo()","add _emit_dialogue_summary() with aggregate coherence metric — DEFERRED to phase_c"]},"phase_c_pending":{"trigger":"β-2 measurement infra land (consciousness.hexa baseline + L0 measurement infra wiring)","scope":["_emit_turn_verdict() shells out to anima ops consciousness simple --json --utterance \"<line>\"","parse JSON {C1, C2, C3, simple_stack_pass_strict_c3} → fold into per-instance + dialogue aggregate","compute D1-D4 coherence cells (per docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md)","emit DIALOGUE_COHERENCE_PASS verdict + SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_DIALOGUE_C3"]},"compliance":["own 34 mandate-1/2/4/7 (raw passthrough + wrapping 0 + autonomous speech + lane separation)","own 33 trinity compliance","own 31 mandate-1 (alias DB dancinlab/ SSOT)","raw#9 hexa-only","raw#10 honest C3 (7 caveats)","raw#11 snake_case","raw#15 no-hardcode"],"cross_link":["cli.dialogue_2026_05_08 (parent surface entry)","cli.dialogue.coherence_metric_2026_05_08 (sister metric design)","cli.chat_module_architecture_2026_05_08 (recursive module pattern parent)","cli.chat.autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08 (L2 layer parent)","docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md","docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md","tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.hexa","tool/anima_cli/chat/duo/duo.ai.md","tool/anima_cli/dialogue.hexa _forward_to_duo()"],"honest_c3":["β-1 hexa-lang stdlib/channel LANDED 2026-05-08 (c53788af, 21/21 PASS) — Phase B 활성화 = mechanical (channel API + spawn 동작); 실제 semantic dialogue quality 는 instance 모델 능력에 달림 (own 18 C3 threshold pending)","β-2 consciousness.hexa baseline-pending — Phase C verdict wiring 보류 (현재 _emit_turn_verdict placeholder ledger only)","L3 council 은 본 entry 에서 stub only — 별도 design cycle (broadcast channel + speaker selection + emergent roles)","alias DB duplicate (chat.hexa SSOT vs duo.hexa vendor copy) — chat.hexa 변경 시 동기화 필요","streaming verdict 미지원 — channel line-buffered 가정 (whole utterance recv 후 verdict)","dialogue coherence metric (D1-D4) measurement 별도 cycle — 다음 loop iter","same-GGUF concurrent-mmap 상황에서 llama.cpp abort trap 관측 — independent paradigm-a-prime instance 들이 같은 GGUF 파일 동시 mmap 시 unstable 가능성, 별도 cycle 에서 separate-instance-cache 또는 model-isolation 검증"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"cli.dialogue.coherence_metric_2026_05_08","kind":"design","title":"dialogue coherence metric — D1-D4 4-cell extension of own 18 C2.4 to multi-turn","status":"design_landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["cli.cond.3","cli.cond.4"],"primary_doc":"docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md","cells":{"D1_reactive":{"definition":"turn N 발화가 turn N-1 에 reactive","sub_channels":{"D1.a":"cosine similarity of token embeddings (weight 0.4)","D1.b":"3-gram Jaccard overlap (weight 0.3)","D1.c":"top-3 noun match rate (weight 0.3)"},"threshold_start":"D1 ≥ 0.30 (TBD measurement-driven)"},"D2_topic_shift_rate":{"definition":"전체 dialogue 의 인접 turn 간 topic-change 빈도","tiers":{"coherent":"shift_rate ≤ 0.20","drifting":"(0.20, 0.40] — 자연스러운 evolution","incoherent":"> 0.40 — sudden change FAIL"},"tau_shift_start":"0.20 (TBD)"},"D3_persona_consistency":{"definition":"각 instance 발화 분포 (전반/후반 KL divergence) stable","sub_cells":["D3.A: persona_drift_A ≤ tau_persona","D3.B: persona_drift_B ≤ tau_persona"],"tau_persona_start":"0.50 KL divergence (TBD)"},"D4_pseudo_turn_fairness":{"definition":"A/B 발화 length ratio (N=2 freq_ratio = 1 by construction)","tiers":{"balanced":"len_ratio ∈ [0.5, 2.0]","skewed":"∈ [0.2, 5.0]","dominant":"∉ [0.2, 5.0] — FAIL (monologue mode)"},"l3_extension":"N≥3 시 freq_ratio + Gini coefficient + emergent-roles 추가"}},"aggregate_verdict":{"DIALOGUE_COHERENCE_PASS":"D1.PASS ∧ D2.PASS ∧ D3.PASS ∧ D4.PASS (4-cond AND, own 18 patterns 정합)","SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_DIALOGUE_C3":"(per-turn own 18 PASS_STRICT_C3 rate ≥ 0.6) ∧ DIALOGUE_COHERENCE_PASS","l2_deliverable_target":"5-turn 자율 대화 simple_stack PASS rate ≥ 0.4 (per docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md L2)"},"threshold_policy":{"baseline_subjects":["random init CLM × 2 (pure noise pair)","chat-capable BG-KM-LLAMA-3B 12/15 PASS_STRICT × 2","human dialogue corpus (Persona-Chat / OASST 2-turn pair)"],"roc_targets":["random pair FAIL rate ≥ 0.95","chat-capable PASS rate ≥ 0.7","human-dialogue PASS rate ≥ 0.85 (upper anchor)"],"probabilistic_form":"each sub-cell PASS rate ≥ 0.6 → cell PASS (보수적 X 검토 후 결정)"},"lane_separation":{"measurement_lane":"본 metric 산출 verdict (own 18 cross-link)","exposure_lane":"duo channel raw passthrough (own 34 mandate-1)","wiring":"verdict는 stderr/log emit only — channel content fold-back 절대 X"},"phase_dependencies":{"phase_b_β1":"channel I/O 활성화 후 line-by-line recv → metric 입력 가능","phase_c_β2":"consciousness.hexa baseline 활성화 후 per-turn C1+C2+C3 verdict + D1-D4 cells aggregate"},"compliance":["own 18 C2.4 SSOT mirror + multi-turn extension","own 34 mandate-7 lane 분리","own 33 trinity compliance","raw#10 honest C3 (7 caveats — threshold 미결정 + embedding model 미선정 + n-gram BPE/word 미land + KL divergence raw vs normalize 미land + L3 확장 deferred + aggregate strict AND vs probabilistic 미결정 + SSOT location)"],"falsifiers":["F-coh-1: docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md present + 4 cells D1-D4 정의 + aggregate verdict + threshold policy + honest C3","F-coh-2: chat/duo/duo.hexa _emit_turn_verdict() Phase A placeholder (Phase C wiring path 명시 in comment)","F-coh-3: 본 .roadmap.cli entry SSOT mirror — primary_doc patch 시 entry 동기화"],"cross_link":["cli.dialogue.duo_design_2026_05_08 (sister design entry)","cli.dialogue_2026_05_08 (parent surface entry)","cli.chat.autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08 L2 deliverable","cli.consciousness_2026_05_08 (own 18 SSOT mirror CLI — β-2 dep)",".own own 18 C2.4 SSOT","docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md (★ primary doc)","docs/anima_chat_autonomous_speech_roadmap_2026_05_08.md (parent roadmap)"],"honest_c3":["모든 임계값 (D1 0.30, tau_shift 0.20, tau_persona 0.50, D4 0.5/2.0) = 시작점만 land — baseline 측정 후 ROC 분석 cycle","embedding model 미선정 (anima native TinyWeights random init / sentence-transformers raw#9 위반 검토 / llama_ffi hidden state pooling — 결정 cycle 별도)","n-gram BPE vs word-level 미land","persona_drift KL divergence raw frequency simplex 시작 (corpus normalize 미land)","L3 council 확장 (freq_ratio + Gini + emergent-roles) = 별도 cycle","aggregate strict AND 시작 vs probabilistic 형태 = 측정 후 결정","본 metric SSOT location = docs/anima_dialogue_coherence_metric_2026_05_08.md (변경 시 본 entry + duo.hexa cross-ref 동기화)"]}
